<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n1103" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀγών-ισμα</span></b> , τό, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>contest, conflict</i>: in pl.,
				<i>deeds done in battle, brave deeds</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				8.76
			</span></i>; <i>feats</i> of horsemanship, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Eq.Mag.</u>
				3.5
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. κατὰ τὰ ἆθλα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>CIG</u>
					2741
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> in sg.,
				<i>feat, achievement</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. τινος</span>
			<i>a feather in</i> his <i>cap</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				8.12
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				17
			</span></i>: c. inf., <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				7.59
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				86
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ξυνέσεως ἀ.</span>
			<i>prize</i> of sagacity, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				3.82
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀρᾶς ἀ.</span>
			<i>issue</i> of the curse, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Ph.</u>
				1355
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. ποιεῖσθαί τι</span> make it <i>an
				object to strive for</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				1.140
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὐ μικρὸν τὸ ἀ. προστάττεις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Luc.
					<u>Im.</u>
					12
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<i>that with which one contends, declamation</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. ἐς τὸ παραχρῆμα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Th.
					1.22
				</span></i>
			; of plays, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Po.</u>
				1451b37
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>IV.</b> in Law,
				<i>plea</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Antipho
				5.36
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Lys.
				13.77
			</span></i>.</div>
